{
  "provider": "ElevenLabs",
  "speech": {
    "NELL:Who actually saw the current change?": "a2-nell-e156e4e371d46cda.mp3",
    "PIP:The ferry clerk saw her loose line turn. The fish seller saw the launch. The lantern tender heard two bells. None saw a ghost, which has inconvenienced my layout.": "a2-pip-031b1305e36c92ea.mp3",
    "NELL:Two bells?": "a2-nell-0e9292d8ea7c5206.mp3",
    "PIP:One outside, one from the old return pipe. I called it an answer.": "a2-pip-24cb64409e78798b.mp3",
    "NELL:To what question?": "a2-nell-c9980de2458cff4c.mp3",
    "PIP:That was going to be tomorrow's edition.": "a2-pip-81112d77a4889be6.mp3",
    "NELL:Your headline says the lighthouse predicts yesterday.": "a2-nell-82c9b514c2ce40cf.mp3",
    "PIP:An exclusive.": "a2-pip-165715644e25b174.mp3",
    "NELL:Yesterday is unusually well covered.": "a2-nell-5c7b0804879ab029.mp3",
    "PIP:Yes. Competition has been brutal.": "a2-pip-66c377118ad6342e.mp3",
    "NELL:Do you know the name Rook?": "a2-nell-a870657da328194c.mp3",
    "PIP:Town lane, house with the weather vane that argues with the wind. Dr. Rook builds mechanisms. Her family built reasons not to discuss them.": "a2-pip-d7e7d4af83870c13.mp3",
    "NELL:Orin's ship is missing.": "a2-nell-1f1bdd6076a1da83.mp3",
    "PIP:Then I owe him a correction. I printed that it had retired.": "a2-pip-9f6f833408c0db77.mp3",
    "NELL:Did anyone see it?": "a2-nell-f5ffae65f908b422.mp3",
    "PIP:A striped cabin behind the old yard screen. The witness could not see a name.": "a2-pip-00b924e1742f3211.mp3",
    "NELL:Will you print what I find?": "a2-nell-c1199744f986fb3f.mp3",
    "PIP:If I can show readers how you know it.": "a2-pip-29e49ed12165d87e.mp3",
    "NELL:Even if it's less exciting?": "a2-nell-cd0f97883b3f88ea.mp3",
    "PIP:I have a very large typeface. I can make accuracy look alarming.": "a2-pip-9443db5dc047239b.mp3",
    "NELL:I need tracing paper.": "a2-nell-272201ff79c51912.mp3",
    "PIP:The clean tray. Same public supply as the quay. Please don't take a headline; they're still wet.": "a2-pip-200cfbde729e0400.mp3",
    "NELL:Back to the harbour.": "a2-nell-77a3ff0f602ef422.mp3",
    "PIP:Bring facts. I can provide the exclamation marks.": "a2-pip-7fb3b332937972f9.mp3",
    "NELL:What is breakfast waiting for?": "a2-nell-29584ccaa258b581.mp3",
    "ROOK:The heater waits for the serving bell. The bell waits for the table. The table waits for the heater to finish. My grandfather called this perfect supervision.": "a2-rook-f91e82b6f36196bb.mp3",
    "NELL:Why not turn the whole thing off?": "a2-nell-3959e01fdb0cfae9.mp3",
    "ROOK:The trolley brake releases under local control. Kill the supply and it stays across the workshop door, celebrating its final decision.": "a2-rook-dfe45af5684549be.mp3",
    "NELL:Could each part do its own job?": "a2-nell-b51eb33a2281ef59.mp3",
    "ROOK:Yes. The labels explain how. I have been rather busy preventing the tea from entering a new state of matter.": "a2-rook-b32f97e1b58916a9.mp3",
    "NELL:Can I help?": "a2-nell-2ed420cd44875062.mp3",
    "ROOK:Keep the heater warm, park the table, put the bell on hand control. Then release the trolley. In that order, if you value the cups.": "a2-rook-a2d4e213875fd53a.mp3",
    "NELL:Does the harbour work like your breakfast?": "a2-nell-c3d0c3159a521e60.mp3",
    "ROOK:Not literally. I have never charged a ship for marmalade. Finish here and I will show you the distinction.": "a2-rook-c94f4f7569df78c1.mp3",
    "NELL:I'll look at the controls.": "a2-nell-752c9805ade6e962.mp3",
    "ROOK:Read the little words. My family spent generations engraving them and minutes following them.": "a2-rook-de7aa27826714aaf.mp3",
    "NELL:Is this your relay?": "a2-nell-e530b2944b212d16.mp3",
    "ROOK:Our pattern, replacement shutters. This number belongs to the repair-yard service inlet. Here is its drawing.": "a2-rook-109d7a916929f923.mp3",
    "ROOK:Bring a maker's name and relay number. The retired housing on the quay should still have its plate.": "a2-rook-bb5c0d7ae9530b01.mp3",
    "NELL:Why did nobody mention the service channel?": "a2-nell-da37fd181d70c753.mp3",
    "ROOK:It was for inspections, not through traffic. Commercial charts stopped printing it. Water is less attentive to revised editions.": "a2-rook-99fc72b26adf9d60.mp3",
    "NELL:How do I inspect the barrier safely?": "a2-nell-a745d7ed2f339b7e.mp3",
    "ROOK:Set the inlet to INSPECT. Open the equalising valve. Wait for the two marked levels to agree. Then turn the local crank. The interlock prevents you doing the dangerous version.": "a2-rook-40d1dec0578e7bee.mp3",
    "NELL:Can I borrow that crank?": "a2-nell-7ecae23c5f05f8b4.mp3",
    "ROOK:Yes. It only fits this inspection socket. Please return it to its bracket when the barrier is latched.": "a2-rook-14182b6f0c0020b6.mp3",
    "ROOK:Let me identify the mechanism first. ‘Approximately the right crank’ is a dangerous engineering tradition.": "a2-rook-3f57fbee2b061d18.mp3",
    "NELL:Can a local station disagree with the central controls?": "a2-nell-0a3f308afa030135.mp3",
    "ROOK:For inspection, yes. Larger coordination is another matter. This drawing covers one barrier, not the whole network.": "a2-rook-d201bfed6be9933c.mp3",
    "NELL:Why are you reluctant to discuss your family?": "a2-nell-c94cc4f852c9928e.mp3",
    "ROOK:We put our name on systems before we understood everyone who would depend on them.": "a2-rook-ec6398ce082a5cce.mp3",
    "NELL:And now?": "a2-nell-8d97e35df7397ce9.mp3",
    "ROOK:Now I read the little words.": "a2-rook-b9a950b9628451bb.mp3",
    "NELL:Vane offered to pay for my measurements.": "a2-nell-acaebeeed895f69c.mp3",
    "ROOK:Accurate measurements are useful. Ask what permission travels with them.": "a2-rook-3de3e7891126e505.mp3",
    "NELL:Could she use them to make it safer?": "a2-nell-4ed1eae5ff46f329.mp3",
    "ROOK:Yes. That is why the question matters.": "a2-rook-d7333eaa02e26fb8.mp3",
    "NELL:I freed the ship.": "a2-nell-fa018561079b92b0.mp3",
    "ROOK:Then the inspection route did its job. Leave the barrier in its marked safe position.": "a2-rook-cf6ba38e7bbba0b7.mp3",
    "NELL:I should get back to the quay.": "a2-nell-efd91c3044bb5adb.mp3",
    "ROOK:If a mechanism surprises you, stop turning it. An unpopular but serviceable rule.": "a2-rook-a32e41f167c4cccd.mp3",
    "NELL:I'm following the signal equipment.": "a2-nell-1e78508bda1447de.mp3",
    "MARA:Then find who made it, who uses it, and who says those are the same person.": "a2-mara-7870cdc341e0ec37.mp3",
    "NELL:I borrowed your boathook.": "a2-nell-f466580029279d46.mp3",
    "MARA:Bring it back when it has finished being useful. It was wasted on the wall.": "a2-mara-00a6fd7d500755b3.mp3",
    "NELL:Vane says my work is worth paying for.": "a2-nell-ee92650f9325f158.mp3",
    "MARA:It is. That doesn't tell you what she wants to buy.": "a2-mara-d75f4ec9eedad1ed.mp3",
    "NELL:Should I take the commission?": "a2-nell-f068ac4618b65d03.mp3",
    "MARA:Read it. Keep your original. Ask what happens to the copy. The choice is yours.": "a2-mara-4c68439bd3967134.mp3",
    "NELL:I found Orin's ship.": "a2-nell-3ddecac3ffb9c5a6.mp3",
    "MARA:Good. Perhaps he'll stop using my tables to demonstrate where it isn't.": "a2-mara-63659da5b112940f.mp3",
    "NELL:Do you know anything about the old gates?": "a2-nell-babe7db8091424cc.mp3",
    "MARA:Enough to know their drawings deserve care. Bring me what you can actually establish.": "a2-mara-7c5fa9437fa83e40.mp3",
    "NELL:I'll keep looking.": "a2-nell-6fd9c0d779e61928.mp3",
    "MARA:Eat something before you decide the fate of the harbour.": "a2-mara-bf486784f1628c94.mp3",
    "NELL:Why didn't you look behind the screen?": "a2-nell-cb3e795d4bed1db1.mp3",
    "ORIN:The notice said CLOSED CHANNEL. I interpreted it rather completely.": "a2-orin-2b848b1d19e27fe8.mp3",
    "NELL:I saw the stripes and the kettle.": "a2-nell-f980dbc6e7b95281.mp3",
    "ORIN:Then she is there.": "a2-orin-2834ee2a8a6d161a.mp3",
    "NELL:You sound surprised.": "a2-nell-7db132b9560aafea.mp3",
    "ORIN:Relieved. I have been performing surprise to avoid that.": "a2-orin-fe95d8a3e44b0013.mp3",
    "NELL:Come to the inlet.": "a2-nell-717f867dd67b95a7.mp3",
    "ORIN:Open the inspection access safely first. I can wait without making another navigational decision.": "a2-orin-4add27f1d2d2377c.mp3",
    "ORIN:I'll meet you there. Bring a proper mooring line.": "a2-orin-01dccd54d3b3cba0.mp3",
    "NELL:Any advice on the old survey?": "a2-nell-fa48f162ea90bd79.mp3",
    "ORIN:Trust fixed marks. Correct what you can measure. Leave a clear note where you can't.": "a2-orin-3de1f4b76f0d386c.mp3",
    "NELL:I'm investigating the company's trials.": "a2-nell-24b52488f387094f.mp3",
    "QUIBBLE:At last. A rival with enough paperwork to deserve being called a trial.": "a2-quibble-1a4da45e1122727e.mp3",
    "FINE PRINT:Record dates. Insults age poorly as evidence.": "a2-fine-print-e034e4aff467eef6.mp3",
    "NELL:What does ‘operational use of measurements’ mean?": "a2-nell-ff57ea2cd4d52aaf.mp3",
    "FINE PRINT:It means they may operate using the measurements. A sentence can be perfectly honest and still deserve your attention.": "a2-fine-print-15e73e881ebe1347.mp3",
    "NELL:Their licence allows public inspection.": "a2-nell-a237b522494fdb05.mp3",
    "QUIBBLE:Then inspect publicly.": "a2-quibble-4c7ca6975b879c40.mp3",
    "FINE PRINT:Safely. He omits adverbs when excited.": "a2-fine-print-de8b209f99c300dd.mp3",
    "NELL:I found a way to recover Orin's ship.": "a2-nell-9441628ccdb078e1.mp3",
    "QUIBBLE:A fine rescue. I once rescued a fleet.": "a2-quibble-ab168f8b146c94fe.mp3",
    "FINE PRINT:Of receipts. From a puddle.": "a2-fine-print-29ff95f0f2a2c6b0.mp3",
    "NELL:I need advice, not another duel.": "a2-nell-31c63abce9ad8ca2.mp3",
    "QUIBBLE:Then you may cross. I am experimenting with relevance.": "a2-quibble-5209c62765c985e0.mp3",
    "NELL:What will you do with my copy?": "a2-nell-4624d591264f829e.mp3",
    "VANE:Calibrate the service route and coordinate it with our marked passage. The commission says operational use.": "a2-vane-e4111276a18a9f59.mp3",
    "NELL:Will other boats benefit?": "a2-nell-feaae3b92d1da6f7.mp3",
    "VANE:A dependable harbour benefits every operator. The terms of access will be published.": "a2-vane-7d2bfaf56f37e931.mp3",
    "NELL:That is not the same as free access.": "a2-nell-6959eb92d88f6f2c.mp3",
    "VANE:No. Maintenance, crews and liability cost money. I do not propose to finance them with optimism.": "a2-vane-10bcf7ca2dc2393e.mp3",
    "NELL:My evidence doesn't prove you caused every change.": "a2-nell-866f8e50a4d72058.mp3",
    "VANE:Correct. That distinction is one reason I am hiring you.": "a2-vane-4c52068f7345f389.mp3",
    "NELL:The trials hid Orin's ship.": "a2-nell-3844e38fa3b56920.mp3",
    "VANE:His vessel followed a trial marker into a service basin. We will correct the notice. I am paying for better measurements because imperfect arrangements have consequences.": "a2-vane-07946687551258d6.mp3",
    "NELL:I want public safety written into the purpose.": "a2-nell-90decf76e2d1a6f1.mp3",
    "VANE:Agreed: ‘for safe local routing.’ The operating-policy clause remains.": "a2-vane-94a1c660f0e3378b.mp3",
    "NELL:I would like the credit to say independent surveyor.": "a2-nell-8e3c3cb7b59a4a5f.mp3",
    "VANE:Independent surveyor Nell. A precise description.": "a2-vane-b632c489302550c1.mp3",
    "NELL:I need time to decide.": "a2-nell-a2ae23ca9d5d0c35.mp3",
    "VANE:Take it. Precision is wasted if you sign without reading.": "a2-vane-596a35bb2beeb9c9.mp3",
    "NELL:You knew what I wanted this to achieve.": "a2-nell-771db3bb45e25c49.mp3",
    "VANE:I knew you wanted accurate routes and paid work. You have provided the first and received the second.": "a2-vane-50b3a6a4571f3a5e.mp3",
    "NELL:Safety doesn't require owning every way through.": "a2-nell-e10727bd15b8327a.mp3",
    "VANE:Someone must accept responsibility for coordinating them.": "a2-vane-f64f805900da3b77.mp3",
    "NELL:Responsibility isn't the same as exclusive permission.": "a2-nell-2d6b3bb8b2a145ba.mp3",
    "VANE:We disagree about the practical difference.": "a2-vane-358013a6638685da.mp3",
    "NELL:Withdraw my name.": "a2-nell-32ad9f3eb8425446.mp3",
    "VANE:I can record your objection. I cannot pretend the work was not yours.": "a2-vane-2ab48221806b4520.mp3",
    "NELL:Can we leave now?": "a2-nell-c51eb9922dae7b5a.mp3",
    "ORIN:She is ready. Finish your business ashore and speak to Mara. I will check the rigging; no voyage improves because someone skipped that.": "a2-orin-94012b43c97813b3.mp3",
    "NELL:Do you mind if I question your route?": "a2-nell-2ebc8ebb05cfee9b.mp3",
    "ORIN:I have named the ship Second Opinion. It would be poor seamanship to object.": "a2-orin-08e0629b671aea75.mp3",
    "NELL:What did we prove?": "a2-nell-fc92f03647a8b0dd.mp3",
    "ORIN:That the new marker diverted me, and a barrier hid the vessel. Not who gave the order. Keep those separate.": "a2-orin-6c9827d01a635fee.mp3",
    "NELL:What do you make of the company announcement?": "a2-nell-2d5fc62ab54af6bb.mp3",
    "PIP:Your name is on their route sheet.": "a2-pip-871392811b4e313c.mp3",
    "NELL:So is the measurement I gave them.": "a2-nell-c70875731e378dce.mp3",
    "PIP:Then we print the distinction. A correction is not an erasure.": "a2-pip-ebae190e8afa37c6.mp3",
    "ROOK:I told you to ask about permission.": "a2-rook-9b777aeb180fb254.mp3",
    "NELL:I asked. I wanted the answer to mean something kinder.": "a2-nell-943771a20f76d9a7.mp3",
    "ROOK:Then next time we must make the answer less optional.": "a2-rook-f102d889c00d1e35.mp3",
    "FINE PRINT:Compulsory contracts. The word ‘all’ has found its teeth.": "a2-fine-print-6f83fa0836367462.mp3",
    "QUIBBLE:Can we stop it?": "a2-quibble-897f96adc90ceb6f.mp3",
    "NELL:Not by cutting something we don't understand.": "a2-nell-9c77ae8d0cc62822.mp3",
    "ORIN:The boat is ready.": "a2-orin-320fd4e06b348edd.mp3",
    "NELL:I have something to put right before we sail.": "a2-nell-3e96e5f1202cb8c2.mp3",
    "ORIN:Then start with the person you need to tell.": "a2-orin-f1dede6920c786d8.mp3",
    "MARA:You look as though being right has gone badly.": "a2-mara-e7fccbb99fac3356.mp3",
    "NELL:I need to tell you what I gave Vane.": "a2-nell-648ef45ccb5c13e9.mp3",
    "MARA:Then we'll make time.": "a2-mara-afa66e5833f6c045.mp3",
    "VANE:Nell? Your drawing distinguishes a current from a rumour. That is rarer than you might think.": "a2-vane-27bd966bbda08632.mp3",
    "NELL:You read my notes?": "a2-nell-144498c5adb1b928.mp3",
    "VANE:The public account. I would like to pay for a more complete survey.": "a2-vane-6318dfa08ebbdca9.mp3",
    "NELL:Of the channel, or of how much I know?": "a2-nell-5f69ca467329e29c.mp3",
    "VANE:The first. The second appears to be increasing without my assistance.": "a2-vane-338811196f81f41f.mp3",
    "VANE:Bring measurements, Miss Nell. I have cupboards full of assurances.": "a2-vane-98fba50188ef8e2b.mp3",
    "NELL:For once, a qualification I possess.": "a2-nell-c0be1867a0fc859b.mp3",
    "PIP:Welcome to the Quay Quill. Are you news, a correction, or here about the roof?": "a2-pip-9b0859d190b0e195.mp3",
    "NELL:The water changed direction after a company signal.": "a2-nell-3979b4f5d783d0fb.mp3",
    "PIP:News. Possibly a correction to several things I printed about the water.": "a2-pip-59b3924a163eb985.mp3",
    "NELL:Can I see the original reports?": "a2-nell-abb34c3f3fc6f6d3.mp3",
    "PIP:Certainly. The facts are underneath the adjectives.": "a2-pip-f3904615e333be3b.mp3",
    "PIP:Signal, current, launch. Three facts in order. I've had shorter careers in journalism.": "a2-pip-1058aaae4eb70220.mp3",
    "NELL:I compared the reports at the quay.": "a2-nell-b40b7de632c5322a.mp3",
    "PIP:Excellent. I shall describe this as our distributed newsroom.": "a2-pip-1e251b8891310d54.mp3",
    "NELL:I'll change ‘predicts’ to ‘repeats.’": "a2-nell-3a8ede79acc890d8.mp3",
    "PIP:You have reduced a supernatural exclusive to a plumbing complaint.": "a2-pip-4edf18cb0b6de34a.mp3",
    "NELL:Now people can fix it.": "a2-nell-807c41ed30699476.mp3",
    "PIP:A dangerous precedent for a newspaper.": "a2-pip-4bb86136a8df73fa.mp3",
    "NELL:The signal comes first. The clerk's line turns. Then the waiting launch moves.": "a2-nell-a7fc7828ba995988.mp3",
    "PIP:So our reliable claim is that somebody was prepared.": "a2-pip-1da3659a4d3e5193.mp3",
    "NELL:Yes. Not that the sea joined the company.": "a2-nell-b9fbdac1370a3ab1.mp3",
    "PIP:I will reluctantly withdraw its employee portrait.": "a2-pip-2c0d470f1f09b70b.mp3",
    "ROOK:Don't sit down. The table has not approved the chairs.": "a2-rook-06f6c02aa73baa18.mp3",
    "NELL:Are the chairs applying separately?": "a2-nell-eba63aa2b08f577b.mp3",
    "ROOK:That is precisely the sort of question this house encourages.": "a2-rook-c935efdd4a9ae755.mp3",
    "NELL:I'm following a signal relay with your family's name on it.": "a2-nell-1368cb8f43a8869e.mp3",
    "ROOK:Then you have found a second system I would prefer to discuss while it is not boiling.": "a2-rook-ae28c0582d1226da.mp3",
    "NELL:Warm tea. Parked table. Bell waiting for a person. Astonishingly ordinary.": "a2-nell-e25ca9fd27db2655.mp3",
    "ROOK:You have removed the management structure.": "a2-rook-862d8377c5da14b3.mp3",
    "NELL:It was obstructing the door.": "a2-nell-96c487abf888f67e.mp3",
    "ROOK:Come into the workshop.": "a2-rook-50e42fa98cb8f48a.mp3",
    "NELL:The house is working. Are we allowed to sit?": "a2-nell-e72ccda7b0bfc35b.mp3",
    "ROOK:The chairs have formed a waiting list.": "a2-rook-171dcd647347a088.mp3",
    "NELL:At least they've found a standing arrangement.": "a2-nell-bacb3af34e3ba74b.mp3",
    "NELL:What does it make of pocket lint?": "a2-nell-bab1c364936b61c5.mp3",
    "ROOK:An unlicensed nebula. Please keep it. The sorter charges by constellation.": "a2-rook-a5a483975622a8ea.mp3",
    "ROOK:My family made local routing gear. Gates, relays, things that should be boring when they work.": "a2-rook-4cc6fdbf0f205f54.mp3",
    "NELL:The company signals before the current turns.": "a2-nell-c506043f7efe80e4.mp3",
    "ROOK:Then someone has put part of the network back into service.": "a2-rook-88567335045cf755.mp3",
    "NELL:Can it control the tide?": "a2-nell-c1d6d3ff7c97f080.mp3",
    "ROOK:It can redirect water through connected channels. The moon remains regrettably independent.": "a2-rook-a1842f16798a3c28.mp3",
    "NELL:A striped cabin behind a movable wall. Either Orin's ship is here, or architecture has taken up sailing.": "a2-nell-e4c812e8bce227f8.mp3",
    "NELL:Second Opinion. Present, afloat, and making a strong case against ‘vanished.’": "a2-nell-15a6f22cd056a393.mp3",
    "ORIN:I followed the new marker. It led straight into the service inlet.": "a2-orin-0839f114dc906cb4.mp3",
    "NELL:And when the barrier closed?": "a2-nell-6d7156474de6baa4.mp3",
    "ORIN:I called it fog. I was standing on land at the time.": "a2-orin-1c156e61f944db5f.mp3",
    "NELL:The marker was wrong for your journey. You can say that without claiming the ship evaporated.": "a2-nell-7244d8b4fcaebf72.mp3",
    "ORIN:I trusted the sign over what I knew. There. An unpleasantly navigable sentence.": "a2-orin-08b92a4121f7ea1f.mp3",
    "NELL:Can she reach Bellweather Shoal?": "a2-nell-a044b5e29160d37a.mp3",
    "ORIN:With a current survey and someone willing to question the navigator.": "a2-orin-7244e578d9237b18.mp3",
    "NELL:I have been practising.": "a2-nell-69b412dfdecb5cc1.mp3",
    "NELL:The drain and pillar agree with the old drawing. The basin gives me the missing level.": "a2-nell-064077656a74eef4.mp3",
    "NELL:A short service channel. A small correction. I can finally put my name beside something useful.": "a2-nell-e3d352b1d879bac8.mp3",
    "ORIN:Second Opinion. Cream cabin, three blue stripes, copper kettle for a weather vane.": "a2-orin-fdb363c3303d3fdd.mp3",
    "NELL:A kettle?": "a2-nell-5153f0e316c0b751.mp3",
    "ORIN:It always points away from the weather. Better judgement than several instruments.": "a2-orin-86517328f4432ffc.mp3",
    "NELL:Where did you last see her?": "a2-nell-1a43bcee959abb78.mp3",
    "ORIN:By the new arrow behind the repair yards. I stepped ashore. When I returned, a timber screen occupied the view.": "a2-orin-3fa94a1b25ed687d.mp3",
    "VANE:You have a boat and a correction. An unusually productive afternoon.": "a2-vane-88a85514840834a7.mp3",
    "NELL:The boat was already there. That was part of the correction.": "a2-nell-d44e00f3ff3f98f7.mp3",
    "VANE:And the service measurement?": "a2-vane-637658e7feb3dfd6.mp3",
    "NELL:Checked against fixed marks, with the basin equalised.": "a2-nell-68e2df9b9d7740a0.mp3",
    "VANE:Then let us put your name on it.": "a2-vane-c529d6dc21791765.mp3",
    "NELL:Original retained. Working copy dated. Uncertainty labelled instead of wished away.": "a2-nell-72dd2742803881d9.mp3",
    "NELL:Here is the copy. The correction is local. The limitations are on the page.": "a2-nell-19c3d12464ee6be0.mp3",
    "VANE:And your name is on the commission. Twelve crowns, credited in full.": "a2-vane-eff3dbdb5944086f.mp3",
    "NELL:Independent surveyor Nell.": "a2-nell-48e4b648c200a2e5.mp3",
    "VANE:You have made the missing connection.": "a2-vane-d576ad07ca1134c3.mp3",
    "NELL:I hope it helps people find their way.": "a2-nell-3682e2fe07a80049.mp3",
    "VANE:It will make the route dependable.": "a2-vane-f5587f10a66035bb.mp3",
    "VANE:At the next major tide, all commercial passage through the managed channels will operate under a Fair Passage contract.": "a2-vane-2db66bd2ae3484e5.mp3",
    "NELL:All passage?": "a2-nell-c271c908c91812af.mp3",
    "VANE:Uncoordinated access makes coordinated safety impossible.": "a2-vane-844a660c7ac151af.mp3",
    "NELL:You hired me to correct a route.": "a2-nell-3d4207966134c777.mp3",
    "VANE:And you did. Excellently.": "a2-vane-4d62c059fd94906b.mp3",
    "NELL:That's my correction. Not a forgery. Not a misunderstanding.": "a2-nell-ab023803331b0a3c.mp3",
    "NELL:I helped finish the route they mean to charge everyone for.": "a2-nell-e762d3cd17fe525c.mp3",
    "NELL:I wanted somebody important to say my work mattered.": "a2-nell-9251ed72f2e946e7.mp3",
    "NELL:It matters. Now I have to decide what I do about that.": "a2-nell-b4dd4d95fe223344.mp3",
    "NELL:Right, Nell. Take stock. You have a borrowed boathook, an old survey, and a pencil that has somehow become responsible for your career.": "a2-nell-858f20debd2b397f.mp3",
    "NELL:At the landing, the signal came first. Then the local current changed. Then the company launch sailed through. That is a sequence, not proof that somebody has bought the ocean.": "a2-nell-3c7f45656a854199.mp3",
    "NELL:I need other witnesses. Pip’s newspaper might have reports worth comparing, once I separate the facts from the exciting punctuation.": "a2-nell-e547ba2d4ae14871.mp3",
    "NELL:Then there is the signal hardware at the repair quay. Find its maker, find out what it actually does. Preferably before touching anything labelled experimental.": "a2-nell-b3b2de93b45d577e.mp3",
    "NELL:And Orin’s missing ship. Boats rarely disappear out of embarrassment, even when their navigators would like them to. I should ask him for a proper description.": "a2-nell-fdcf4e3ea1777c84.mp3",
    "NELL:Check the witnesses. Follow the machinery. Find the boat. If I can explain this harbour, perhaps I can finally reach Bellweather Shoal. One well-supported mistake at a time.": "a2-nell-9cefa0ea448464d5.mp3",
    "NELL:I was told you understand the harbour machinery.": "a2-nell-53fded6e6ca46a48.mp3",
    "NELL:The credit is real. So is what they have done with the measurements.": "a2-nell-1b55021262901a13.mp3",
    "ORIN:I will meet you at the inlet. Bring a proper mooring line.": "a2-orin-50bee7e7e6097ec8.mp3",
    "NELL:I need their attention, not their coat.": "a2-nell-148655572a420d0d.mp3",
    "NELL:A poor conversationalist. Excellent at holding its position.": "a2-nell-347ab7e7763bbc3a.mp3",
    "NELL:You may look. I am keeping the original.": "a2-nell-d917c278bebbef32.mp3",
    "NELL:A rope with a purpose. This puts it ahead of several committees.": "a2-nell-bee37d01c8763119.mp3",
    "NELL:The mooring rope is already doing its job at the inlet.": "a2-nell-27648db0c98a9a38.mp3",
    "ROOK:Observe what moves. Then observe what does not.": "a2-rook-67d83308edc01913.mp3",
    "NELL:Got it. The small line can carry the big idea.": "a2-nell-127bcaa47f320b7d.mp3",
    "NELL:A little farther than an arm. Fortunately, I borrowed a longer argument.": "a2-nell-062cc85fd48d053b.mp3",
    "NELL:A sound line to a sound post. Refreshingly little philosophy.": "a2-nell-2a0d364b0e4bb400.mp3",
    "NELL:The basin is calm. The staff reads the middle marked line.": "a2-nell-19745b57fa69cc94.mp3",
    "NELL:Let the two levels settle first.": "a2-nell-993408e33781773e.mp3",
    "NELL:Useful here. Awkward in a pocket.": "a2-nell-05d3e0c0c7df2c90.mp3",
    "NELL:I have enough. An expedition need not begin with hoarding.": "a2-nell-0868f584b1f826f3.mp3",
    "NELL:One sheet. I intend to make a small, precise mess.": "a2-nell-852447bdb2688adb.mp3",
    "NELL:Different witnesses. The same order. Enough to investigate; not enough to accuse everyone with a bell.": "a2-nell-0a6d15c698e8937c.mp3",
    "NELL:T. ROOK & FAMILY. LOCAL CHANNEL RELAY 7. TOWN LANE WORKSHOP. A clue with excellent manners.": "a2-nell-d6070575758f04e4.mp3",
    "NELL:Witness statements. The useful bits have survived the handwriting.": "a2-nell-37a4a2fd80894979.mp3",
    "NELL:Courtesy paper. A rare form of paper that does not want something.": "a2-nell-f1e5bfdc8bde981a.mp3",
    "NELL:Public mooring line. Return it attached to something that ought to stay put.": "a2-nell-0f9bdf4b8d077291.mp3",
    "NELL:A firm surface for making a careful copy.": "a2-nell-00fea6089d2adf88.mp3",
    "NELL:Public inspection access must remain operable during trials.": "a2-nell-f750430c9f9fecc0.mp3",
    "NELL:A company route sheet, carrying my service-channel annotation.": "a2-nell-5d73c9a1c9b018d9.mp3",
    "NELL:Ink on one cuff. More ink on the cuff used to wipe it off.": "a2-nell-43395f4348e963fe.mp3",
    "NELL:Each pigeonhole contains evidence. The pigeons appear to have escaped questioning.": "a2-nell-315cabb6fe618d93.mp3",
    "NELL:A place to check a sentence before it becomes everybody’s problem.": "a2-nell-53771bfafc2fb1b1.mp3",
    "NELL:One clean sheet amid a forest of accusations.": "a2-nell-ffeab6c9a1f0ccc9.mp3",
    "NELL:LIGHTHOUSE PREDICTS YESTERDAY. At least it can check its work.": "a2-nell-ae16ba9b618ffd67.mp3",
    "NELL:A machine for making a small error very widely available.": "a2-nell-7cec6535be1e0f47.mp3",
    "NELL:An inventor trying to prevent tea from entering a new state of matter.": "a2-nell-f4cbbafb006dfce1.mp3",
    "NELL:The heater waits for the bell. The bell waits for the table. The table waits for the heater.": "a2-nell-6418382945215f83.mp3",
    "NELL:PARK HERE BEFORE RELEASING TROLLEY. The furniture is better instructed than most crews.": "a2-nell-5be30e350f7642da.mp3",
    "NELL:RESERVED FOR OCCUPANT. OCCUPANT AWAITING RESERVATION.": "a2-nell-8e888ec733471386.mp3",
    "NELL:It has classified a potato peel as a minor moon.": "a2-nell-af600e249cfc384f.mp3",
    "NELL:She reads the little words before touching the big levers.": "a2-nell-f5c8fa708d990c75.mp3",
    "NELL:Three channels, linked gates, one basin. A sea small enough to contradict politely.": "a2-nell-0755c49f50a0965e.mp3",
    "NELL:SERVICE INLET 7. Fixed marks: square drain; split granite pillar.": "a2-nell-4399a4e165d06b9f.mp3",
    "NELL:Square socket. Long handle. A respectable way to disagree with a gate.": "a2-nell-6111a663a9ab843e.mp3",
    "NELL:Several generations looking certain about progressively larger machines.": "a2-nell-80a58119bfb92e7c.mp3",
    "NELL:Cream cabin. Three blue stripes. A copper kettle where the weather vane should be.": "a2-nell-ebff4f60b1dcf683.mp3",
    "NELL:RUN or INSPECT. I would like the setting that expects questions.": "a2-nell-7e3c009ab81e1e4c.mp3",
    "NELL:The thin line brings the heavy rope aboard. A small job with a sensible ambition.": "a2-nell-d6cb63732f7c6e14.mp3",
    "NELL:Sound timber. No theatrical opinions about ownership.": "a2-nell-526ab74d01bb1788.mp3",
    "NELL:Square drain, at the waterline. A fixed mark that does not mind getting wet.": "a2-nell-2100c022e7c705c0.mp3",
    "NELL:That crack appears on the old drawing. Stone has been keeping notes.": "a2-nell-79262f9c60a8e73c.mp3",
    "NELL:Three clearly marked levels. I need the equalised reading.": "a2-nell-26132a5bf741659e.mp3",
    "NELL:Align the square drain and the split granite pillar.": "a2-nell-ef548e84f285eaf5.mp3",
    "NELL:Three stripes, copper kettle, and an owner who owes it an apology.": "a2-nell-59bb7a5e1c1456be.mp3",
    "NELL:His certainty is quieter near the boat.": "a2-nell-321c37d52fc60419.mp3",
    "NELL:Composed, attentive, and very certain where every page belongs.": "a2-nell-29abcc721e3b0e3c.mp3",
    "NELL:Provisional local routing trials. Public inspection access must remain available.": "a2-nell-290933c7086bdfea.mp3",
    "NELL:The harbour, reduced to something one person can put a hand over.": "a2-nell-dbecf97ab5245283.mp3",
    "NELL:Twelve crowns for a verified annotated copy. Operational calibration and local route planning. The original remains mine.": "a2-nell-7a257dd29e4ee989.mp3",
    "NELL:For copies. My original is remaining unusually close to me.": "a2-nell-ecfb6c603bb0c1af.mp3",
    "NELL:CENTRAL EMERGENCY SIGNALS TO BE ANNOUNCED PUBLICLY.": "a2-nell-39f46e35e233b520.mp3",
    "NELL:Practical advice, without a charge for the truth.": "a2-nell-ab8c39671225432d.mp3",
    "NELL:A navigator whose vessel is still waiting for him.": "a2-nell-e1ed69d40f376a57.mp3",
    "NELL:Empty, with the key still in its lock. My original survey stays with me.": "a2-nell-7f78970df5d8552f.mp3",
    "NELL:An old rival trying to remain relevant.": "a2-nell-7334129b44df6b16.mp3",
    "NELL:A partner, not a talking accessory.": "a2-nell-8e68358c8b18d11a.mp3",
    "NELL:The float remains safely tethered. The signal preceded the change.": "a2-nell-47940beb578e9774.mp3",
    "NELL:My baseline and the observation are preserved in the notebook.": "a2-nell-4a60f2cfe62f0d2e.mp3"
  },
